    "description": "Tokyo Sangyo Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells machinery, plant facilities, materials, tools, and chemicals in Japan and internationally. The company operates through Electric Power Business; Environment, Chemicals, and Machinery Business; and Lifestyle Industry Business segments. It installs power generation equipment, such as thermal and nuclear power plant peripheral equipment, power transmission and transformation equipment, etc., and provides maintenance and after-the-sale services of existing equipment for electric power companies. The company also sells and provides installation support for machinery used in chemical plants and renewable energy, as well as machine tools for chemical, petroleum refining, pharmaceutical, textile, rubber, and non-ferrous metal industries. In addition, it is involved in the marine and fishery businesses; and lifestyle related businesses, including water-saving automatic flushing devices, shopping bags, fashion bags, garbage bags, packaging materials, etc. The company was formerly known as Tokyo Kenzai Kogyo Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Tokyo Sangyo Co., Ltd. in July 1947. Tokyo Sangyo Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1942 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
